            "review_title": "Review at Thu Bồn Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Catherine\nBrisbane, Australia1 contribution\n0\nGorgeous people and hotel!\nSep 2026 • Family\nA lovely resort right on the river, just outside Hoi An’s Old Town. The staff couldn’t have been friendlier (Khuyên in particular is wonderful!) and our rooms were spacious and comfortable. It’s especially great for families, with plenty of room for the kids to run around and two beautiful pools to choose from: one rooftop and one riverside.\nWritten September 20, 2026",
