            "review_text": "Andrew P\n11 contributions\n0\nAmazing service\nSep 2026 • Couples\nWe had an amazing experience with live music and food .Khuyên was an amazing host\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten September 13, 2026\nNguyen T\nDear Valued Guest,\n\nThank you very much for sharing your wonderful feedback with us.\n\nWe are delighted to hear that you had an amazing experience enjoying our live music and food. It is especially wonderful to know that Khuyên provided you with attentive and memorable service. We will certainly share your kind compliments with her and the entire team.\n\nYour appreciation means a great deal to us and motivates our team to continue creating exceptional experiences for our guests.\n\nWe sincerely look forward to welcoming you back to Bel Marina Hoi An Resort for another memorable dining experience.\n\nWarm regards,\nFood & Beverage Team\nRead more\nWritten September 14, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
